            "description": "<p><a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/josh-lipton/\">Josh Lipton</a> and <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/alexandra-canal/\">Allie Canal</a> outline some of the top stories investors are watching on Monday, including Chinese stocks \u2014 like Alibaba (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BABA\">BABA</a>), Baidu (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/BIDU\">BIDU</a>), and JD.com (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/JD\">JD</a>) \u2014 gaining on President Trump's softened tariff threats on China, and top analyst calls \u2014 like Intel's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/INTC\">INTC</a>) downgrade and Estee Lauder's (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/EL\">EL</a>) upgrade.</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-domination/\">Market Domination</a>.</p>",
